  CellName: Longshot
  Description: 'Thornfield - intensity 4 of Longshot: sixteen lances zig-zagged into three short runs
    out by the membrane. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u), no environment,
    no flora and no fauna. The field (16 lances of 48 cubes in 48 runs, 768 prisms in all,
    847 u out) is laid by LongshotController. 2 omni crystals respawn inside the nucleus
    (the scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (11,568 prisms,
    943,488 volume). Authored by Tools/Build/author_longshot_assets.py - re-run it rather
    than hand-editing.'
